# Draw a card with an empty library and an empty hand: nothing is drawn, so the hand holds 0 cards and no life is lost, and Bot1 loses the game the next
# time state-based actions are checked (CR 121.4, 704.5b). Bot1's deck is exactly its opening hand plus one Ornithopter, drawn on turn 3 and cast, so the
# library and the hand are both empty when Castle Locthwain's ability resolves; life stays 20.

[Bot1 Deck]
Castle Locthwain
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Castle Locthwain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Castle Locthwain.Activate(Ability: Draw a card)

[Expect]
Result = Bot2 won
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Hand.Count = 0
